OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Flargely die out this evening leaving
OL,7,Fmost places dry with clear spells.
OL,8,FRemaining windy on the west coast with
OL,9,Ffurther showers through the night.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FRather windy with showers in
OL,12,Fthe west, some heavy at times. Further
OL,13,Feast it will mainly dry, with the
OL,14,Flongest sunny spells around the Moray
OL,15,FFirth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
