OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRather
OL,6,Fchangeable with showers or longer
OL,7,Fspells of rain on Friday. Generally
OL,8,Fdrier on the weekend but still with a
OL,9,Ffew showers or spells of rain, and
OL,10,Fwindy at times.
